"test":{"name":"script-order-targets","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptOrderTargets","question":"Order Units' targets and Units Exposed: a Blue tank ordered at whoever holds the city (Target On Tile) attacks the Red grunt on it, not a nearer one; Units Exposed (grunts on cover below 2) counts the grunt on grass and the one on the city's ground (cover 2 is not below 2: not that one), not the one in the forest; Target Exposed picks the grunt on the grass, never the supply unit (it cannot use cover).","rules":"standard"},
